/*
 * Represents a block of macro-call content along with indentation trimming
 * metadata.
 *
 * The trimming value(`trim`) corresponds to the indentation offset applied
 * when a newline is encountered during location computation.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::macro_::solve::model
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/macro_/solve/model.yr
